title: "TeachDiffusion: Open-Source Video Diffusion for Math Education"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ish"
    given-names: "Calyx"
    alias: "calyxish"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TeachDiffusion/TeachDiffusion"
url: "https://github.com/TeachDiffusion/TeachDiffusion"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-03-24"
keywords:
  - video-diffusion
  - math-education
  - intelligent-tutoring
  - wan2.2
  - lora
  - pedagogy
  - open-source
abstract: >-
  TeachDiffusion is an open-source video diffusion model that generates
  math teaching videos featuring a realistic AI human teacher. It uses
  a pedagogy-aware conditioning system to encode teaching intent into
  video generation, built on a fine-tuned Wan 2.2 model.
